WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:05.150
It’s the end of the world as we know it,
and you’re feeling...less than fine.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.260
That’s because some of the SCP Foundation’s
greatest fears have been realized, and we’re

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:14.420
in the middle of an XK Class End of the World
Scenario.

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:17.930
But what exactly is an XK Class, specifically?

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:22.990
How does it fit in among the other K-Class
scenarios that the Foundation stays ever vigilant

00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:23.990
for?

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:28.099
What are some of the ways the world can end
as a result of anomalous activity, and if

00:00:28.099 --> 00:00:31.779
one of these events does unfold, what can
be done to stop it?

00:00:31.779 --> 00:00:36.010
Well grab your water filters and head down
to the nearest Foundation-approved apocalypse

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:41.870
bunker, not that it’ll save you, because
we’re talking XK Class End of the World

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:42.870
Scenarios!

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:47.270
Sadly for us, there’s actually a huge number
of ways that the life and reality we consider

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:50.030
“normal” can suddenly disappear.

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:54.870
These are known to the Foundation as “K-Class
Scenarios”, a description given to any event

00:00:54.870 --> 00:00:59.399
that will severely alter reality or normality
on a global scale.

00:00:59.399 --> 00:01:03.920
There are too many of these to list right
now, but the most prominent threats are SK,

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:09.700
NK, CK, ZK, and of course, XK Scenarios.

00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:16.490
An SK scenario is when another species or
civilization surpasses or replaces humanity,

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:22.860
such as the threat that the Foundation believes
SCP-1000 poses, while an NK, or “Grey Goo”,

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:28.479
Scenario posits that the world may be overrun
by out of control, self-replicating nanomachines,

00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:31.820
covering everything in grey goo.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:37.080
CK-Class restructuring scenarios refer to
a situation in which some kind of reality-warping

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:41.380
anomaly irreparably alters or restructures
reality as we know it.

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:47.200
By contrast, a ZK-Class “End of Reality”
scenario involves an anomaly in physics causing

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.740
reality in general to just cease.

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:56.299
But most feared of all, and the most abundant
in its potential causes, is the XK Class End

00:01:56.299 --> 00:01:58.270
of the World Scenario.

00:01:58.270 --> 00:02:01.189
This is quite literally the apocalypse.

00:02:01.189 --> 00:02:02.189
Armageddon.

00:02:02.189 --> 00:02:03.210
Judgment day.

00:02:03.210 --> 00:02:04.490
End times.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:05.590
Lights out.

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:10.619
There are well in excess of sixty anomalies
capable of triggering an XK Class Scenario,

00:02:10.619 --> 00:02:13.180
and sadly, far fewer that can reverse them.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:14.180
T.S.

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:19.220
Eliot wrote, “This is the way the world
ends, not with a bang but a whimper.”

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:23.739
As anyone at the SCP Foundation could tell
you, there are plenty more ways the world

00:02:23.739 --> 00:02:24.950
can end than that.

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:31.080
Here are some of the most strange, terrifying,
or downright interesting examples of anomalous

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.260
apocalypses.

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:36.190
Starting with the more ridiculous end of the
apocalyptic scale.

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:42.750
SCP-871 is a series of over 200 cakes, varying
in size and variety of cake.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:46.650
If any of these cakes are eaten, they’ll
be replaced by a magically appearing cake

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:48.050
within 24 hours.

00:02:48.050 --> 00:02:52.400
However, if the cakes are not eaten, they’ll
still produce a replacement.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:55.820
If the cakes are damaged but not eaten, a
replacement will appear instantaneously.

00:02:55.820 --> 00:03:01.769
In other words, if the replication is not
properly inhibited by the SCP Foundation,

00:03:01.769 --> 00:03:07.150
there’s a considerable risk of the world
being overrun with impossible quantities of

00:03:07.150 --> 00:03:08.150
cake.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:13.190
It may seem silly, but Foundation scientists
have estimated that an uncontrolled outbreak

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:19.879
of SCP-871 would render the world completely
uninhabitable in a mere 80 days.

00:03:19.879 --> 00:03:24.690
The Foundation tracks a number of frightening
SCPs capable of quickly getting out of control

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:32.840
such as the 100% infectious and deadly prion
SCP-008, and SCP - 610, aka The Flesh That

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:33.840
Hates.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:38.519
But, none seem to present the same genuine
threat to human life as an epidemic of global

00:03:38.519 --> 00:03:40.370
cake duplication.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:46.190
Another bizarre anomaly capable of causing
an abrupt apocalypse is SCP-5092.

00:03:46.190 --> 00:03:51.320
This anomaly is a strange phenomena that exclusively
affects every sitting US President.

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:56.180
At 7:53 PM every single night, the president’s
nose will begin to itch.

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:59.970
When this happens, naturally, the president
will itch his nose.

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:05.220
This may seem like an extremely innocent pattern
of behavior, but the true danger occurs when

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:10.549
the president affected by 5092 doesn’t act
on this sudden and irritating itch.

00:04:10.549 --> 00:04:17.650
If the president doesn’t itch, it will cause
SCP-5092-1 to spontaneously manifest.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:23.840
5092-1 is a massive asteroid, over twenty
kilometers in diameter, that manifests above

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:28.410
the North Pole and begins hurtling towards
earth at incredible speeds.

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:34.150
If the president fails to scratch his nose
by 8:53 PM every single night, this asteroid

00:04:34.150 --> 00:04:39.850
will collide with Earth and invariably cause
an XK-Class End of the World Scenario.

00:04:39.850 --> 00:04:43.690
The Foundation is required to keep a constant
watch on the current sitting US President

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:46.250
for this exact reason.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:48.990
SCP-2950 is in a similar situation.

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:53.650
It’s not necessarily always a potential
XK Class waiting to happen, but under the

00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:57.060
right circumstances it absolutely can be.

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:02.190
According to the surface-level files, 2950
is an anomalous folding metal chair.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:06.910
When sat on for over an hour, it becomes impossible
to convince the sitter to leave the chair

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.480
without using force.

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:15.310
However, as a file only accessible by a single
member of O5 Council reveals, 2950 is actually

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:20.449
an anomaly that takes the form of whatever
the majority of people aware of it think it

00:05:20.449 --> 00:05:21.449
is.

00:05:21.449 --> 00:05:25.460
The misinformation about it actually being
a chair has been spread this whole time just

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:27.850
to reduce its potential threat.

00:05:27.850 --> 00:05:32.560
An ancient tome from the sacred library of
the Serpent’s Hand though, depicts 2950

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:37.180
as an all-powerful and incredibly deadly XK
Class Scenario Threat.

00:05:37.180 --> 00:05:42.090
If this book ever fell into the wrong hands
and its information was shared, it would become

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:48.169
a self-fulfilling prophecy, and likely result
in the exact kind of XK Class apocalypse we

00:05:48.169 --> 00:05:49.639
fear.

00:05:49.639 --> 00:05:55.139
SCP-2935, also known as “O’ Death”,
is a limestone cavern in Indiana leading to

00:05:55.139 --> 00:06:01.170
an alternate world that already experienced
an XK Class End of the World Scenario, a complete

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:05.960
and total extinction event so powerful it
even led to the deaths of thought-to-be-immortal

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:10.050
figures like SCP-682 and Dr. Bright.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:14.139
While the cavern is thankfully now sealed
off, it’s believed that the force of pure

00:06:14.139 --> 00:06:19.069
death lurking on the other side is more than
capable of causing the same mass extinction

00:06:19.069 --> 00:06:22.940
event in our reality if ever it gained passage
here.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:26.900
Another anomaly very likely to cause an XK
Class End of the World Scenario is a creature

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:33.840
known as The Devourer Of Worlds which lives
in a desert-like pocket dimension beyond SCP-2317.

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:39.270
While the beast is currently bound, Foundation
scientists anticipate it breaking from its

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:44.389
bonds and moving into our dimension, at which
point it’s likely to live up to its name

00:06:44.389 --> 00:06:46.710
and eat all of us.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:52.930
Perhaps the most feared entity in all of SCP
Foundation lore, The Scarlet King is an ultra-powerful,

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:58.340
godlike being created by the tension between
organized modernity and the primal violence

00:06:58.340 --> 00:06:59.640
of the past.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:03.950
The Scarlet King makes repeated attempts to
enter our reality, and his various devoted

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:07.020
cults do what they can to help him make the
jump.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:11.600
It’s believed that if he ever did find his
way into our dimension, the end of the world

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:17.780
is an extremely likely outcome, given his
seething hatred for all modern societies.

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:22.110
Some anomalies don’t seem to cause XK Class
End of the World Events, but they are predicted

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:25.730
to potentially cause them to happen some time
in the future.

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:32.040
One such example is SCP-3769, a seemingly
normal scientific calculator that binds itself

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:34.000
to the body of whatever touches it.

00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:38.510
It then, depending on the number input into
the calculator, regresses the biology of the

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:41.510
user into some prior stage of evolution.

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:47.971
But when the calculator was tested on SCP-411,
a 400 year old man who ages in reverse, it

00:07:47.971 --> 00:07:52.610
broke, and began performing the exact opposite
function to what was intended.

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:56.990
It started evolving the subjects it touched
into future stages of evolution.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:02.099
While this worked successfully on all animals
tested, from octopi to macaques, it killed

00:08:02.099 --> 00:08:06.690
every human it was tested on even when the
evolution feature was cranked down to its

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:09.060
smallest setting of a single generation.

00:08:09.060 --> 00:08:13.889
Humans, it seems, are at the end of the road
in terms of our evolutionary journey.

00:08:13.889 --> 00:08:18.440
Foundation Scientists have posited that this
could foretell an XK-Class human extinction

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:23.150
event within our lifetimes, though we don’t
know what form it will take.

00:08:23.150 --> 00:08:28.389
Another SCP that seems to function as a grim
omen is SCP-152.

00:08:28.389 --> 00:08:32.789
This is a large, hardcover book that features
startlingly detailed descriptions of events

00:08:32.789 --> 00:08:35.880
in the past, present, and future.

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:41.930
The one common denominator is that small differences,
often about the actions of the Foundation,

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:46.240
lead to calamitous XK Class End of the World
Scenarios in the book.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:51.190
The Foundation has found this incredibly pessimistic
work of literature valuable as an instruction

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:55.670
guide in avoiding the coming disasters that
it predicts, but it’s possible that it may

00:08:55.670 --> 00:09:00.170
somehow predict an incoming XK that we can’t
wriggle out of.

00:09:00.170 --> 00:09:07.350
Another grim harbinger of a potential dark
future is SCP-1678, also known as “Unlondon.”

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:12.440
This sprawling dystopian city beneath modern
day London suggests an XK Class extinction

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:18.630
scenario above ground caused by rampaging
anomalies getting loose from Foundation containment.

00:09:18.630 --> 00:09:22.750
The museum in the doomed underground city
displays a number of dangerous, Keter Class

00:09:22.750 --> 00:09:25.720
anomalies wreaking havoc on the surface world.

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:30.750
For all we know, these horrifying events may
someday come to pass for us.

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:34.529
At this point, it’s understandable if you’re
feeling a little paranoid.

00:09:34.529 --> 00:09:39.870
With all these possible XK Scenarios looming
over us, from being smothered by cake to doom

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:44.670
foretold by a calculator, it’s easy to let
a sense of hopeless roll over you.

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:48.370
And these aren’t even all of the anomalies
capable of doing this.

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:52.570
But never fear, there are three anomalies
out there that have the capability to reverse

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:55.920
even some of the most dire XK situations.

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:58.899
The one hope is that they can be reached in
time.

00:09:58.899 --> 00:10:02.750
One of the more practical methods is activating
SCP-2000.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:07.180
This anomaly is a huge facility hidden beneath
Yellowstone National Park.

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:12.019
Through a number of anomalous technologies,
2000 is capable of making exact copies of

00:10:12.019 --> 00:10:15.570
everyone who existed on earth in the last
20 years.

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:19.940
The facility also stores all human knowledge,
allowing things to pick up right after they

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:21.180
left off.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:26.030
This new race of humans is then able to rebuild
society from the ground up, at which point

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:31.350
the Foundation will re-emerge and erase everyone’s
memories of the XK Class End of the World

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:33.610
Scenario that started it all.

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:36.870
SCP-2000 isn’t effective in all situations
though.

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:41.550
What if, for example, the XK scenario destroyed
the conditions for supporting human life on

00:10:41.550 --> 00:10:42.550
Earth?

00:10:42.550 --> 00:10:48.540
Or what if SCP-2000 itself is destroyed during
the process of the XK Class Scenario?

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:53.040
Thankfully, when it seems like all other hopes
have failed, there are two remaining anomalies

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:57.300
that can function as a sort of total reset
button if brought together, no matter the

00:10:57.300 --> 00:10:59.529
severity of the apocalypse.

00:10:59.529 --> 00:11:07.510
These are SCP-055, the unknowable Anti-Meme,
and SCP-579, another mysterious anomaly known

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:10.560
only by its extensive containment procedures.

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:16.600
The combination of the anomalous effects of
055 and 579, as laid out in Roget’s Proposal

00:11:16.600 --> 00:11:23.390
and the article for SCP-2998, is the Foundation’s
ultimate secret weapon for preventing an XK-Class

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:25.290
end of the world scenario.

00:11:25.290 --> 00:11:30.649
If the two are united during said scenario,
the universe resets to a time before the XK

00:11:30.649 --> 00:11:32.970
Class started and prevents it from happening.

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:37.519
That’s why, if the world is ending around
you, there’s no better hope of canceling

00:11:37.519 --> 00:11:42.360
the apocalypse than bringing 055 and 579 together.

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:46.180
So there you have it: Everything you need
to know to have a basic knowledge about the

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.580
end of all life on Earth.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:52.930
Preventing an XK Class End of the World Scenario
is like playing an extremely high stakes game

00:11:52.930 --> 00:11:57.670
of whack-a-mole, you never really know when
the next existential threat is going to pop

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:58.670
up.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:02.720
And perhaps the one that finally ends it all
is closer than you think...

00:12:02.720 --> 00:12:09.450
Now go check out “SCP Chaos Insurgency Explained”
and “SCP - 4511 - SWINE GOD” for more

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.250
frightening Foundation facts!

